pgbx
Copyright (c) 2026 Muthukumaran Navaneethakrishnan (MIT, see LICENSE)

Point-in-time restore (cli/src/wal.rs, cli/src/s3x.rs, cli/src/pitr.rs) ports designs from pgBackRest:
async archive-push with a spool and parallel look-ahead pushes, archive-push-queue-max drop semantics,
archive-get prefetch, parallel multipart S3 transfers, time-based backup/WAL expiration.
No pgBackRest code is executed; https://github.com/pgbackrest/pgbackrest

